{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using the scvi_n200 encoder on single-profile data, isolating the RNA encoder choice. Validation accuracy of 0.520 and F1 of 0.498 suggest a slight improvement over the previous PCA encoder baseline. Uncertainty remains about how this performance compares to multimodal configurations or other encoding strategies, as no such comparisons have been evaluated."
}

